1
00:00:02,514 --> 00:00:10,286
Yeh hai aapka AI office. Har cabin mein ek AI staff member hai, jo aapki trading ka ek kaam sambhalta hai.

2
00:00:10,514 --> 00:00:18,286
Kavya chief of staff hai. Saare desks ki report jodkar subah-shaam ek hi page ki briefing banati hai.

3
00:00:18,514 --> 00:00:26,286
Aaj kya hua, kis desk ne kya dekha, aur kahan aapki OK chahiye, sab ek jagah mil jaata hai.

4
00:00:26,514 --> 00:00:34,286
Arjun raat bhar ka market, results calendar aur aapki watchlist ki news padhta hai.

5
00:00:34,514 --> 00:00:42,286
Subah 8:45 par ek minute ka brief aapke phone par aa jaata hai, aapke apne rules ke hisaab se.

6
00:00:42,514 --> 00:00:50,857
Meera aapke trading group ke har idea ko note karti hai: kisne diya, kya tha aur kab aaya.

7
00:00:51,086 --> 00:00:59,429
Har idea aapke rules se check hota hai. Hara matlab rules mein fit, laal matlab koi rule toot raha hai.

8
00:00:59,657 --> 00:01:08,000
Aur score bhi rakhti hai: pichhle 30 din mein kiske ideas sach mein chale, aur kiske nahi.

9
00:01:08,229 --> 00:01:16,000
Ira har trade broker se khud utha leti hai. Aapko journal mein kuch bhi type nahi karna.

10
00:01:16,229 --> 00:01:24,000
Phir dikhati hai ki paisa kis setup se bana aur kahan gaya, group ke ideas samet.

11
00:01:24,229 --> 00:01:32,000
Kabir din bhar aapki positions ko aapke hi banaye rules se milata rehta hai.

12
00:01:32,229 --> 00:01:40,000
Loss limit, position size, margin: rule tootne se pehle hi WhatsApp par warning aa jaati hai.

13
00:01:40,229 --> 00:01:48,000
Aapki OK ke bina kuch nahi badalta. Har trading decision aapka hi rehta hai.

14
00:01:48,229 --> 00:01:54,857
Aage chalkar Tax, Backtest aur Research desk bhi khul sakte hain.

15
00:01:55,086 --> 00:02:03,429
Yeh office tips nahi deta aur order nahi lagata. Yeh aapko aur aapke group ko apne hi plan par disciplined rakhta hai.

